WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.152
Read large numbers in groups of three digits. Say the thousands group first, then the

00:00:05.152 --> 00:00:06.472
hundreds, tens and ones.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:14.080
Choose the number name for 909,010. The answer is nine hundred and nine thousand ten.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.611
909,010 is read as nine hundred and nine thousand ten.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:23.948
A sign during a library project says “four hundred and eighty-seven thousand fifty”.

00:00:23.948 --> 00:00:27.407
Which numeral should be printed? Pause the video and think.

00:00:28.283 --> 00:00:34.920
A sign during a library project says “four hundred and eighty-seven thousand fifty”.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:41.556
Which numeral should be printed? The answer is 487,050. Convert the place-value words

00:00:41.556 --> 00:00:42.577
to 487,050.
